SDV test1:
VSS :
    Sensor Signal Camera (SSP:10ms+/-2ms, DL: 5ms+/-2ms)
    Sensor Signal Lidar (SSP:10ms+/-2ms, DL: 5ms+/-2ms) 

    Actuator Signal FrontBrake (periodic 10ms+/-2ms, AD: 5ms+/-2ms)
    Actuator Signal RearBrake (periodic 10ms+/-2ms, AD: 5ms+/-2ms)
 
App :
    Component AEBS_controler :
       
 
        Signal Alarm
        Service s1:
            subscribe to VSS signal Camera  
            subscribe to VSS signal Lidar
            publish to VSS signal FrontBrake
            publish Alarm
            
            triggered on Lidar 
            execution 3ms+/-1ms 

    Component SecondControler :
      
        Service s2:
            subscribe to Alarm
            publish to VSS signal RearBrake 
            periodic 10ms+/-1ms
            execution 3ms+/-1ms
        // service s3:
        //     triggered on Al
        //     ExecTime 3+/-1ms

Functional Chains:
 chain : Lidar -> s1 -> FrontBrake 